{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/606911-confusion-over-kith-blessing","id":606911,"title":"Confusion over kith blessing","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-07-29T12:20:28-07:00","id":606911,"title":"Confusion over kith blessing","content":"I am building a Darkling Nightsinger character right now, and looking at its kith blessing, it says, &quot;<span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana\">The player spends a point of Glamour and makes a Performance + Wyrd roll...&quot; The problem, of course, is that Performance isn't a a skill. Now, I assume they meant Expression and made a mistake, but that brings up another problem with my character concept. She's a singer, and I'm not entirely sure what Attribute would go into an Expression roll for singing. I'm assuming Presence, but I'd like to hear the opinion of others, as I don't want to put my points in the wrong attribute.</span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6117-kerostasia-nemesis","name":"Kerostasia Nemesis","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-29T13:35:29-07:00","id":607013,"title":"","content":"Presence for singing, no doubt.<br /> <br /> I would also -assume- that they mean Expression is meant to replace Performance, but I couldn't say 100%.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6030-a_newfie","name":"A_Newfie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"92"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-29T14:10:53-07:00","id":607085,"title":"","content":"Aye, Presence seems the best fit to me, too.<br /> <br /> And yes, Performance was the oWoD version of Expression; someone likely just went on auto-pilot and missed it in editing.<br /> <br /> Amusingly, the previewed Kiths rough draft for 2e's Nightsinger had that same bit of copypasta in it. Dave seemed entertained, but made clear that he'd be evincing it from the final version for the proper &quot;Expression.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://avatarcomic.net/exalted-wiki/Exalted_3E:What_We_Know\" target=\"_blank\">The EX3 What We Know Wiki</a>, courtesy of Marin and JMobius<br /> <a href=\"http://nishkriya.com\" target=\"_blank\">Nishkriya, the EX3 Freelancer Quotes Tracker</a>, courtesy of Anathema and Moonwolf<br /> <a href=\"http://forums.whitewolfarchive.com/\" target=\"_blank\">The White Wolf Forum Archive</a>, courtesy of The Dark Wizard and Sanctaphrax (see <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/PhilippeSaner?u=159709\" target=\"_blank\">its Patreon</a>) <hr />Arrghus: There's also the Shepherd of the North Star, busily guiding the one thing in all the heavens that <i>doesn't move</i>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/558-gaius","name":"Gaius","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2028"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-29T14:36:39-07:00","id":607130,"title":"","content":"Thirding Presence as the typical Attribute for an Expression pool. There might be niche applications \u2014 maybe Wits to improvise a normally pre-prepared performance, or Manipulation if you approach your art cynically like a tool to evoke certain responses more than getting into the feeling of the song yourself? \u2014 but Presence would easily be the most common Attribute to pair with Expression, being about force of personality, magnitude of impact or impression made, forthright charisma and, well, presence projected.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-29T14:53:38-07:00","id":607150,"title":"","content":"Yeah, I figured the writer derped and didn't remember that Performance wasn't a skill. And the editor... well, it must have sounded right to them because of oWoD, so they didn't change it. I'm glad they will be getting rid of the error for 2E.<br /> <br /> Thank you all for your verification. It will help immensely in building my character.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6117-kerostasia-nemesis","name":"Kerostasia Nemesis","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}